fixture pogo_bounce_control
doc control for pogo_bounce_uses_up_jump_pressed_in_strike: the same pogo with no jump press keeps the bounce's 794 u/s and the air jump.
room test/spikes
spawn 800 300
frames 60
input
  2 jump
  3..29
  30 D attack
  31..59 D
end
expect
  mark bounce 30..40 event.pogo=1
  at bounce vy=-3388 air_jumps=1
  at bounce+1 air_jumps=1 vy=-3217
  mark top bounce..bounce+20 vy>=0
  at top y<=378u air_jumps=1
end
